==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Kamen Rider Cat (Rare Cat)|Kamen Rider Cat]], [[Cat Godzilla (Rare Cat)|Cat Godzilla]], [[Evangelion Cat (Rare Cat)|Evangelion Cat]] and [[Ultraman Cat (Rare Cat)|Ultraman Cat]]

==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As the Doge Darks and Shadow Boxer K can all spawn before the enemy base is even hit, [[Ultraman Cat (Rare Cat)|Ultraman Cat]] should focus on waiting most of them out and defeating them alone. This is a considerable jump in difficulty from the previous stages, but it should still be manageable. The main idea is to take care of the Shadow Boxer K before hitting the base, as the Gory Dark duo backed by Le'noir can be challenging by themselves. Overall, high enough levels should still work here, but [[Cat Combo]]s are considerably more useful in this battle.

